{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0060-s004", "text": "Den som flyttar till Finland ska ansöka om ett skattekort hos Skatteförvaltningen när hen ska börja arbeta i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T071251904207+0000-3/hb-c12-u0060-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.24, "peak": 0.36138916015625, "generation_seconds": 42.143283403944224, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0061-s001", "text": "Folkpensionsanstalten, FPA, ansvarar till stor del för den sociala tryggheten för alla som bor eller arbetar i Finland genom att till exempel betala olika ekonomiska bidrag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T071251904207+0000-3/hb-c12-u0061-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 15.185850340136055, "peak": 0.500823974609375, "generation_seconds": 60.81034722784534, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0061-s002", "text": "Syftet med den sociala tryggheten är att trygga människors utkomst när de inte själva kan göra det.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T071251904207+0000-3/hb-c12-u0061-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.6378231292517, "peak": 0.29022216796875, "generation_seconds": 30.98204164300114, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0061-s003", "text": "Orsaker till det kan vara ålderdom, sjukdom, arbetslöshet, barnafödsel eller studier.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T071251904207+0000-3/hb-c12-u0061-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.484527587890625, "generation_seconds": 32.80309281987138, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0062-s001", "text": "Rätten till bidrag från FPA baserar sig i allmänhet på antingen boende eller arbete i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T071251904207+0000-3/hb-c12-u0062-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.30694580078125, "generation_seconds": 33.05649577593431, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0062-s002", "text": "Vem som har rätt till bidrag beror på bidraget och tjänsten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T071251904207+0000-3/hb-c12-u0062-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.227020263671875, "generation_seconds": 20.6683098860085, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0062-s003", "text": "En invandrares rätt till vissa stöd och tjänster beror på till exempel huruvida hen har kommit till Finland på grund av arbete, studier eller något annat.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T071251904207+0000-3/hb-c12-u0062-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.235374149659863, "peak": 0.35772705078125, "generation_seconds": 46.42083585401997, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0063-s001", "text": "Sysselsättningstjänster är tjänster som hjälper människor att få arbete.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T071251904207+0000-3/hb-c12-u0063-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.28460693359375, "generation_seconds": 23.43593634502031, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
